{"conclusion_raw":"To reassemble your device, follow these instructions in reverse order.","conclusion_rendered":"<p>To reassemble your device, follow these instructions in reverse order.<\/p>","difficulty":"Moderate","documents":[],"flags":[],"guideid":66802,"image":{"id":887755,"guid":"RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr","mini":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr.mini","thumbnail":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr.thumbnail","140x105":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr.140x105","200x150":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr.200x150","standard":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr.standard","440x330":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr.440x330","medium":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr.medium","large":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr.large","huge":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr.huge","original":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/RXdsMSkvYTBcvTNr.full"},"introduction_raw":"It's always a good idea to disconnect the battery before working on your vehicle's ignition system or other electrical components. (If you need to fully remove or replace the battery, [guide|66817|follow this guide instead].)\n\nThis guide uses a Toyota Corolla to demonstrate the procedure, which is similar for most motor vehicles.\n\n'''Note''': Disconnecting your battery may erase certain stored settings, such as radio\/navigation presets and power window memory. Consult your owner's manual for details.","introduction_rendered":"<p>It's always a good idea to disconnect the battery before working on your vehicle's ignition system or other electrical components. (If you need to fully remove or replace the battery, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ifixit.com\/Guide\/Car+and+Truck+Battery+Replacement\/66817\">follow this guide instead<\/a>.)<\/p>\n\n<p>This guide uses a Toyota Corolla to demonstrate the procedure, which is similar for most motor vehicles.<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Note<\/strong>: Disconnecting your battery may erase certain stored settings, such as radio\/navigation presets and power window memory. Consult your owner's manual for details.<\/p>","featured_document_embed_url":"","featured_document_thumbnail_url":"","locale":"en","parts":[{"text":"Battery terminal grease","notes":null,"type":"","quantity":1,"url":"\/Item\/Battery_terminal_grease","wiki_url":"\/Item\/Battery_terminal_grease","wiki_title":"Battery terminal grease","thumbnail":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/UKgaqREKYPPCRyKm.thumbnail","isoptional":false,"featured":false}],"prerequisites":[],"steps":[{"title":"","lines":[{"text_raw":"Before you begin, switch the ignition '''off''' and remove the key.","bullet":"icon_caution","level":0,"lineid":null,"text_rendered":"Before you begin, switch the ignition <strong>off<\/strong> and remove the key."},{"text_raw":"Make sure the transmission is in Park (or first gear if you have a manual gearbox) and that the parking brake is engaged.","bullet":"black","level":0,"lineid":null,"text_rendered":"Make sure the transmission is in Park (or first gear if you have a manual gearbox) and that the parking brake is engaged."},{"text_raw":"Put on work gloves and safety goggles if you have them available.","bullet":"icon_caution","level":0,"lineid":null,"text_rendered":"Put on work gloves and safety goggles if you have them available."},{"text_raw":"In addition to being dirty, the battery contains corrosive agents and may release flammable gases.","bullet":"black","level":1,"lineid":null,"text_rendered":"In addition to being dirty, the battery contains corrosive agents and may release flammable gases."},{"text_raw":"Gloves can also help protect you from an unpleasant shock if you accidentally mishandle the battery.","bullet":"black","level":1,"lineid":null,"text_rendered":"Gloves can also help protect you from an unpleasant shock if you accidentally mishandle the battery."}],"guideid":66802,"stepid":136002,"orderby":1,"revisionid":3274667,"pending_patrol":{"gsr":null,"gst":null},"media":{"type":"image","data":[{"id":887429,"guid":"oZg3sLlWij2DALVT","mini":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/oZg3sLlWij2DALVT.mini","thumbnail":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/oZg3sLlWij2DALVT.thumbnail","140x105":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/oZg3sLlWij2DALVT.140x105","200x150":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/oZg3sLlWij2DALVT.200x150","standard":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/oZg3sLlWij2DALVT.standard","440x330":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/oZg3sLlWij2DALVT.440x330","medium":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/oZg3sLlWij2DALVT.medium","large":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/oZg3sLlWij2DALVT.large","huge":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/oZg3sLlWij2DALVT.huge","original":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/oZg3sLlWij2DALVT.full"},{"id":887430,"guid":"IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK","mini":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK.mini","thumbnail":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK.thumbnail","140x105":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK.140x105","200x150":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK.200x150","standard":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK.standard","440x330":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK.440x330","medium":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK.medium","large":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK.large","huge":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK.huge","original":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/IOPe6A5VMBpYtACK.full"},{"id":889147,"guid":"Kk2qwdbFaJwqFcO4","mini":"https:\/\/guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com\/igi\/Kk2qwdbFaJwqFcO4.mini","thumbnail":"https:\/\